Do you know what is going to happen after this door opens?
- Uhh. Yes?
	Good. I won't need to give you a concise and detailed explanation then!
- No...?
	Well, it's quite simple.
	First we will go inside the auction house and find a good spot.
	Then we will size up our potential opponents. Make sure to guess their buying range.
	After that, we will wait for an item that we like to appear.
	Then everyone will place their bids. A good rule of thumb is 75% the value of what you think the item is.
	People will battle it out with their bids. The wealthiest or most desperate will prevail.
	Usually a mix of both.
	Then we go back to our own realms and continue to pull pranks on those pesky inferior living beings.
	Ah also. The bathroom should be on the left side.
